# API base URL. CRITICAL — for a physical phone you MUST use your machine's
# LAN IP. Localhost / 127.0.0.1 only works in iOS Simulator / Android Emulator.
#
# How to find your machine's LAN IP:
#   Windows : ipconfig         → look for "IPv4 Address" on your Wi-Fi/Ethernet adapter
#   macOS   : ifconfig | grep inet
#   Linux   : ip addr show | grep inet
#
# Also: the Laravel backend MUST be started with `--host=0.0.0.0` so it accepts
# connections from outside loopback. Use `composer serve:lan` for the right command.
#
# Example: EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.10:8000/api
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8000/api
